 * drvAdaptec2940 - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvAMDPCSCSIDriver - complete
 * drvBusLogic - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvBusLogicFP - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvDPT2000 - needs compiled and then tested
 * drvSym53C8xx - needs compiled and then tested

sound
 * drvBeepSound - needs compiled and then tested
